			"notes": "Time for another major update, albeit a somewhat small one (kind of).\n- **Switched from Yarn mappings to the official ones** in preparation for [the big obfuscation removal](https://fabricmc.net/2025/10/31/obfuscation.html)\n    - Some classes and many methods and parameters were renamed to better fit the new mappings\n- Removed Item and Block builders, as they were too complicated\n- Added a class to access loot datagen methods, specifically for use with loot events"
		},
