			"notes": "Hey, I'm back with another update, and boy do I have some thing you might have missed while I was posting on [Modrinth!](https://modrinth.com/mod/farests-api)\n- Removed old, pointless RegistryFailure classes\n- Simplified the Block and Item helper classes\n- Added a SoundHelper class\n- Added some methods to Item.Settings\n- Made StatusEffect constructors accessible via the new SimpleStatusEffect class\n- Items can now be made explosion-proof like the Nether Star using a data component\n- Create a tag to create dyeable armor in the data generator"
		},
